ol items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="relative max-w-[var(--user-chat-width,70%)] bg-token-message-surface rounded-3xl px-5 py-2.5"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">Trabalho com atendimento telefonico via google chrome.
Sempre que cai uma chamada, o site exibe um botão "Atender", é preciso clicar para receber a chamada.
Crie para mim uma extensão do chrome para que o atendimento seja "automático" sempre que esse botão aparecer.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex absolute right-0 left-0 flex justify-end"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex items-center p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copiar" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Editar mensagem"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M13.2929 4.29291C15.0641 2.52167 17.9359 2.52167 19.7071 4.2929C21.4784 6.06414 21.4784 8.93588 19.7071 10.7071L18.7073 11.7069L11.6135 18.8007C10.8766 19.5376 9.92793 20.0258 8.89999 20.1971L4.16441 20.9864C3.84585 21.0395 3.52127 20.9355 3.29291 20.7071C3.06454 20.4788 2.96053 20.1542 3.01362 19.8356L3.80288 15.1C3.9742 14.0721 4.46243 13.1234 5.19932 12.3865L13.2929 4.29291ZM13 7.41422L6.61353 13.8007C6.1714 14.2428 5.87846 14.8121 5.77567 15.4288L5.21656 18.7835L8.57119 18.2244C9.18795 18.1216 9.75719 17.8286 10.1993 17.3865L16.5858 11L13 7.41422ZM18 9.5858L14.4142 6.00001L14.7071 5.70712C15.6973 4.71693 17.3027 4.71693 18.2929 5.70712C19.2831 6.69731 19.2831 8.30272 18.2929 9.29291L18 9.5858Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full" dir="auto" data-testid="conversation-turn-3" data-scroll-anchor="false"><h6 class="sr-only">O ChatGPT disse:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 px-6"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-[40rem] xl:max-w-[48rem] group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden" tabindex="-1"><div class="group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn @xs/thread:px-0 @sm/thread:px-1.5 @md/thread:px-4"><div class="relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="dff61fb4-c0ea-44b9-b93e-92a9c61099f2" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-4o"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark"><p data-start="0" data-end="135" class="">Boa! Bora automatizar esse trampo pra você não ficar clicando igual um robô toda vez. Vou te mandar uma base de extensão do Chrome que:</p>
<ol data-start="137" data-end="282">
<li data-start="137" data-end="195" class="" style="">
<p data-start="140" data-end="195" class="">Roda em segundo plano na aba onde rola o atendimento.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="196" data-end="233" class="" style="">
<p data-start="199" data-end="233" class="">Fica de olho no botão "Atender".</p>
</li>
<li data-start="234" data-end="282" class="" style="">
<p data-start="237" data-end="282" class="">Quando o botão aparecer, ele clica sozinho.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start="284" data-end="320" class="">💡 O que eu preciso saber antes:</h3>
<p data-start="321" data-end="377" class="">Só confirma essas paradas pra eu te entregar redondinho:</p>
<ul data-start="378" data-end="643">
<li data-start="378" data-end="509" class="" style="">
<p data-start="380" data-end="509" class="">O botão "Atender" tem algum ID, classe ou texto fixo tipo <code data-start="438" data-end="464">&lt;button&gt;Atender&lt;/button&gt;</code>? (me manda um print ou o HTML se conseguir).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="510" data-end="578" class="" style="">
<p data-start="512" data-end="578" class="">O site muda de URL ou o atendimento sempre rola numa mesma página?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="579" data-end="643" class="" style="">
<p data-start="581" data-end="643" class="">Precisa rodar o script em todas as abas ou só numa específica?</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="645" data-end="724" class="">Mas pra não te deixar esperando, aqui vai uma <strong data-start="691" data-end="723">estrutura básica de extensão</strong>:</p>
<hr data-start="726" data-end="729" class="" style="">
<h3 data-start="731" data-end="753" class="">🧩 <code data-start="738" data-end="753">manifest.json</code></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible!" data-start="755" data-end="1273"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border-medium relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary select-none rounded-t-[5px]">json</div><div class="sticky top-9"><div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary text-token-text-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary flex items-center rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none px-4 py-1" aria-label="Copiar"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Copiar</button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-1 select-none"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M2.5 5.5C4.3 5.2 5.2 4 5.5 2.5C5.8 4 6.7 5.2 8.5 5.5C6.7 5.8 5.8 7 5.5 8.5C5.2 7 4.3 5.8 2.5 5.5Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5.66282 16.5231L5.18413 19.3952C5.12203 19.7678 5.09098 19.9541 5.14876 20.0888C5.19933 20.2067 5.29328 20.3007 5.41118 20.3512C5.54589 20.409 5.73218 20.378 6.10476 20.3159L8.97693 19.8372C9.72813 19.712 10.1037 19.6494 10.4542 19.521C10.7652 19.407 11.0608 19.2549 11.3343 19.068C11.6425 18.8575 11.9118 18.5882 12.4503 18.0497L20 10.5C21.3807 9.11929 21.3807 6.88071 20 5.5C18.6193 4.11929 16.3807 4.11929 15 5.5L7.45026 13.0497C6.91175 13.5882 6.6425 13.8575 6.43197 14.1657C6.24513 14.4392 6.09299 14.7348 5.97903 15.0458C5.85062 15.3963 5.78802 15.7719 5.66282 16.5231Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.5 7L18.5 11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Editar</button></span></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-json"><span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"manifest_version"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-number">3</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"name"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Atendimento Automático"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"version"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"1.0"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"description"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Clica automaticamente no botão 'Atender' quando ele aparece."</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"permissions"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span></span><span><span class="hljs-string">"scripting"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"activeTab"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"host_permissions"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span></span><span><span class="hljs-string">"&lt;all_urls&gt;"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"background"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"service_worker"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"background.js"</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"action"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"default_title"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Atendimento Automático"</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"content_scripts"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span>
      </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"matches"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span></span><span><span class="hljs-string">"&lt;all_urls&gt;"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
      </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"js"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span></span><span><span class="hljs-string">"content.js"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
      </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"run_at"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"document_idle"</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1275" data-end="1278" class="" style="">
<h3 data-start="1280" data-end="1299" class="">🔧 <code data-start="1287" data-end="1299">content.js</code></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible!" data-start="1301" data-end="1637"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border-medium relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary select-none rounded-t-[5px]">js</div><div class="sticky top-9"><div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary text-token-text-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary flex items-center rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none px-4 py-1" aria-label="Copiar"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Copiar</button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-1 select-none"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M2.5 5.5C4.3 5.2 5.2 4 5.5 2.5C5.8 4 6.7 5.2 8.5 5.5C6.7 5.8 5.8 7 5.5 8.5C5.2 7 4.3 5.8 2.5 5.5Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5.66282 16.5231L5.18413 19.3952C5.12203 19.7678 5.09098 19.9541 5.14876 20.0888C5.19933 20.2067 5.29328 20.3007 5.41118 20.3512C5.54589 20.409 5.73218 20.378 6.10476 20.3159L8.97693 19.8372C9.72813 19.712 10.1037 19.6494 10.4542 19.521C10.7652 19.407 11.0608 19.2549 11.3343 19.068C11.6425 18.8575 11.9118 18.5882 12.4503 18.0497L20 10.5C21.3807 9.11929 21.3807 6.88071 20 5.5C18.6193 4.11929 16.3807 4.11929 15 5.5L7.45026 13.0497C6.91175 13.5882 6.6425 13.8575 6.43197 14.1657C6.24513 14.4392 6.09299 14.7348 5.97903 15.0458C5.85062 15.3963 5.78802 15.7719 5.66282 16.5231Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.5 7L18.5 11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Editar</button></span></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-js"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">clickAtender</span></span><span> = (</span><span><span class="hljs-params"></span></span><span>) =&gt; {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span></span><span> botao = [...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">document</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">querySelectorAll</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"button"</span></span><span>)]
    .</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">find</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">btn</span></span></span><span> =&gt; btn.</span><span><span class="hljs-property">innerText</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">trim</span></span><span>().</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">toLowerCase</span></span><span>() === </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"atender"</span></span><span>);

  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span></span><span> (botao) {
    </span><span><span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span></span><span>.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">log</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"[Extensão] Botão 'Atender' encontrado. Clicando..."</span></span><span>);
    botao.</span><span><span class="hljs-title function_">click</span></span><span>();
  }
};

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// Roda a cada 2 segundos</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">setInterval</span></span><span>(clickAtender, </span><span><span class="hljs-number">2000</span></span><span>);
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1639" data-end="1642" class="" style="">
<h3 data-start="1644" data-end="1662" class="">☕ Como testar:</h3>
<ol data-start="1664" data-end="1949">
<li data-start="1664" data-end="1707" class="" style="">
<p data-start="1667" data-end="1707" class="">Cria uma pasta e joga esses arquivos lá.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1708" data-end="1757" class="" style="">
<p data-start="1711" data-end="1757" class="">Abre o Chrome e vai em <code data-start="1734" data-end="1756">chrome://extensions/</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1758" data-end="1793" class="" style="">
<p data-start="1761" data-end="1793" class="">Ativa o "Modo do desenvolvedor".</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1794" data-end="1863" class="" style="">
<p data-start="1797" data-end="1863" class="">Clica em "Carregar sem compactação" e escolhe a pasta da extensão.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1864" data-end="1949" class="" style="">
<p data-start="1867" data-end="1949" class="">Vai pro site de atendimento e... boom! O clique vai rolar quando o botão aparecer.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1951" data-end="1954" class="" style="">
<p data-start="1956" data-end="2124" class="">Se quiser deixar mais ninja (ex: escutar alterações na DOM ao invés de usar <code data-start="2032" data-end="2045">setInterval</code>), dá pra otimizar depois. Mas com isso aí, já dá pra economizar clique e vida.</p>
<p data-start="2126" data-end="2208" class="">Me manda o HTML do botão ou o nome do site se quiser que eu deixe mais específico!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex absolute right-0 left-0 flex justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex items-center p-1 select-none -mt-1 focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none duration-500 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-position:100%_0%] [mask-size:300%_100%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copiar" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Ler em voz alta" data-testid="voice-play-turn-action-button"><span class="touch:w-