<h3 data-start="342" data-end="364" class="">Depois que baixar:</h3>
<ol data-start="366" data-end="649">
<li data-start="366" data-end="442" class="" style="">
<p data-start="369" data-end="442" class=""><strong data-start="369" data-end="388">Extrai o <code data-start="380" data-end="386">.zip</code></strong> numa pastinha qualquer (tipo <code data-start="418" data-end="440">Downloads/autoatende</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="443" data-end="505" class="" style="">
<p data-start="446" data-end="467" class="">Vai no Chrome e abre:</p>
